{"about_the_game":"Traverse a stylized world, solve puzzles and defeat the guardians of Triplicity Island in a fast paced collectible card game. You are given a starting deck of cards and work your way though various challenges. Challenges consist of a combination of evolving block puzzles and NPC encounters. New cards are rewarded for completing matches, win or lose. Build new decks, defeat the guardians, solve puzzles and become a Triplicity Champion!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- 180 different named cards, each of which can have bonus abilities amounting to 1000+ unique cards.<br />\r\n- 9 worlds, 80+ puzzles<br />\r\n- Full deck editor for creating custom decks<br />\r\n- NO BUYING CARD PACKS! Get cards by simply playing the game<br />\r\n- Practice matches against NPCs to get new cards and test new decks<br />\r\n- Standard and Draft tournaments<br />\r\n- Hidden bonus cards","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"22b2df9082e04245f34aa6896a32c40dbdaa591f.jpg","localized_name":"Green","name":"Green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/658330/22b2df9082e04245f34aa6896a32c40dbdaa591f.jpg"},{"icon":"b1a547579aaa4f0ca93702b41155544aa802a5df.jpg","localized_name":"Red","name":"Red","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/658330/b1a547579aaa4f0ca93702b41155544aa802a5df.jpg"},{"icon":"a98ba336e366da8a49ab805e334d8ba3d641f774.jpg","localized_name":"Blue","name":"Blue","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/658330/a98ba336e366da8a49ab805e334d8ba3d641f774.jpg"},{"icon":"4347d9678c5abc89902ac83c893bbd0772fcabb5.jpg","localized_name":"Black","name":"Black","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/658330/4347d9678c5abc89902ac83c893bbd0772fcabb5.jpg"},{"icon":"9a4ae4f376c1c1961bb8ce7b2985c2214da297f8.jpg","localized_name":"White","name":"White","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/658330/9a4ae4f